    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000ty1a](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000ty1a) Magnitude 5.8 earthquake at 10.0 depth occurred on Nov 13 2026 75km SW of Ocucaje. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -14.9934 longitude -75.8807. It impacted 1656 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
